    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_math_a_08a",
      "hash64": "F5BF9F29212F92CC",
      "text": "没错，答对了！\\n答案就是２倍！[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_math_a_08b",
      "hash64": "F5BFA229212F97E5",
      "text": "正确答案是２倍……不过，\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的想法也很不错哦。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
